Skill: blast-radius
Purpose: judge what a change could break outside its diff before a review verdict
carries it to merge.
Derived from the blast-radius skill in the pstack skill collection of the
cursor/plugins repository, https://github.com/cursor/plugins, at revision
60c641e4fad674784b30abcf9f8915dea39df38d, which is MIT licensed, and adapted for
this plugin. The adaptation drops the references to skills this bundle does not
ship, replaces the multi-model step with this pipeline's own review lenses, adds
the worktree hygiene rule the merge gate needs, and reframes the output as a
structured review verdict. The upstream copyright and permission notice, which
that licence requires be carried with the derived work, follow.

